{"data":{"body":"[P2] Avoid publishing before checkpoint eligibility is settled\n\nIf another branch completes the parent during this serialization, a filesystem stage has already published a unique file before the second check discards its envelope. Early-completion map/parallel workflows can therefore leak unreferenced files. Atomically reserve the child checkpoint before serialization, or provide cleanup when that reservation is lost; add a blocking-stage race test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogA3i","finding_digest":"0b9e9a219a6550b32d5a41e32d644fffc5a241984b728e0b5e3601d1b33175e8","finding_id":"arf_v1_bopjuim2mvilglk2ihrs2zcp77","finding_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::serialize::transient-result-publication","identity_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::serialize::transient-result-publication","line":169,"observation_digest":"72270f9c0506b9627844acf0f90c052d5d3b00dd1df989544b4a297235f6a44f","observation_id":"aro_v1_oitq7hafa24we6cevtypsdaffv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/ChildContextOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_bopjuim2mvilglk2ihrs2zcp77","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:12:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tb7tctryogk3ld253sdhjwzl32","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"f001a8f1de90bbda6c82b737ad83e0252bf513d0","reviewer":"codex","start_line":166,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_im32266ytxwytcykamxdwppz2e","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:12:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
